{"type":"user","uuid":"01a1b80c-21f7-7f93-b00a-44e47fa2b1d0","session_id":"01a1b80c-10a1-714c-94fe-186218e3e224","message":{"content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_00_ET_L45A53V7H7AjgIuDpHzi4440","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   1→# Task 007 — 选模卫生与 draft 兼容：去掉重复 cli、forecast 记忆化、Heavy 拒选、check-unused（A1、A5）\n   2→\n   3→## 目标\n   4→\n   5→来自 Blueprint 任务图 T-007（M1）。交付：\n   6→- lib/select.mjs（按模型记忆化，forecast 经 ctx 调用）\n   7→- lib/select-draft.mjs（draft 视图与 Heavy 拒选）\n   8→- scripts/check-unused.mjs 及自测夹具\n   9→- defects/a5-dup-call、a5-forecast-x3、a5-unused 的 [fixed] 部分，a1-quota 的 draft 部分 [fixed]\n  10→\n  11→## 约束\n  12→\n  13→- 只允许写入以下路径（write_scope）：\n  14→  - lib/select.mjs\n  15→  - lib/select-draft.mjs\n  16→  - scripts/check-unused.mjs\n  17→  - test/fixtures/unused/**\n  18→  - test/unit/select-draft.test.mjs\n  19→  - test/unit/check-unused.test.mjs\n  20→  - test/characterization/defects/a5-dup-call.test.mjs\n  21→  - test/characterization/defects/a5-forecast-x3.test.mjs\n  22→  - test/characterization/defects/a5-unused.test.mjs\n  23→  - test/traceability/T-007.json\n  24→- 零第三方运行时依赖，Node 20+ / ESM。\n  25→- 规格以 .collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/design.md、interfaces.md、task-graph.json 为准。\n  26→- 令牌与密钥不得进入仓库、日志或 JSON 输出。\n  27→\n  28→## 建议验收方向\n  29→\n  30→把每条 AC 转成可独立执行的验收命令：\n  31→- AC-020（levels: unit）：draft handle 只有 call，没有 cli 键。在 12 个模型的夹具上，注入的 forecast 计数器（统计调用次数）等于通过前置过滤的模型数，与排序比较器的调用次数无关。defects/a5-dup-call 与 a5-forecast-x3 的 [fixed] 部分通过。\n  32→- AC-021（levels: unit）：draft 视图在 usage 为 Heavy 时，用 AC-015 的金标输入，risk 为 exhausted、critical 或 low_reserve 的模型全部进入 rejected，原因为 E_FORECAST_EXHAUSTION；Normal 和 Light 不因此拒选。只断言拒选集合与原因，不断言排序。defects/a1-quota 的 [fixed] 部分通过。\n  33→- AC-022（levels: unit）：check-unused 对 lib 报告 0 个未使用的导入和顶层函数；对 test/fixtures/unused 恰好报告其中声明的未使用导入和未使用函数。defects/a5-unused 的 [fixed] 部分通过。\n  34→\n  35→任务图给的验收方向：\n  36→- node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-020\n  37→- node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-021\n  38→- node scripts/check-unused.mjs\n  39→\n  40→测试层级：unit\n  41→\n  42→## 非目标\n  43→\n  44→- 不改动 write_scope 之外的文件。\n  45→- 不实现其他里程碑的任务。\n  46→"}],"is_error":false}],"role":"user"},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8","_messageId":"01a1b80c15657060881e568967963838","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b80c15657060881e568967963838","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b80c15657060881e568967963838","traceparent":"00-3f40958935830439216b9e572e25ec75-edb47074163b0488-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b80c-10a1-714c-94fe-186218e3e224,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T22:06:05.305Z"}
