 implement the ellipsis exception. I'll note it in impl.md as following the intent (property access excluded, spread counts).\n\nHmm, but is that \"放宽扫描规则\"? No — it's fixing a scanner bug (spread is a reference, not a property access).\n\nWait, but maybe the intended interpretation: \"前一个字符是 `.`\" where the '.' is a member-access dot. I'll implement: previous char '.' and the char before it is not '.'.\n\nLet me also double check other files: only these three. After fixing, lib will report typeOf and isObject only.\n\nBut careful: does `...selectModels` appear anywhere else? Let me fix and rerun.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8","_messageId":"01a1b80f7cc97f5f8912edb5b57a44ef","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b80f7cc97f5f8912edb5b57a44ef","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b80f7cc97f5f8912edb5b57a44ef","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b80f-7cc9-7f5f-8912-edb767470d2a","traceparent":"00-3f40958935830439216b9e572e25ec75-edb47074163b0488-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b80c-10a1-714c-94fe-186218e3e224,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T22:09:51.403Z"}
