{"type":"user","uuid":"01a1b80f-d3bc-73d9-b116-264e3d12ad28","session_id":"01a1b80c-10a1-714c-94fe-186218e3e224","message":{"content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_00_8c4dN1IsXvTlNg79lelA2470","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully created and wrote to new file: C:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker\\.collab\\worktrees\\007\\test\\unit\\check-unused.test.mjs"}],"is_error":false}],"role":"user"},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8","_messageId":"01a1b80fab62727193b2b08350456fb5","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b80fab62727193b2b08350456fb5","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b80fab62727193b2b08350456fb5","traceparent":"00-3f40958935830439216b9e572e25ec75-edb47074163b0488-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b80c-10a1-714c-94fe-186218e3e224,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T22:10:07.423Z"}
{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b80f-d3d3-7dc9-be8a-3b73c3ebbf7a","session_id":"01a1b80c-10a1-714c-94fe-186218e3e224","message":{"id":"01a1b80fd3d37dc9be8a3b71d6a64d10","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Careful: the regex line in JS source: `'const re = /[\"\\']/'` — inside single quotes I need to escape the single quote: `'const re = /[\"\\']/'` → produces `const re = /[\"']/`. Actually `\\'` in a single-quoted string is an escaped quote → `'`. So the resulting string is `const re = /[\"']/`. Good.\n\nHmm but writing `[\"\\']` — the `\"` inside single quotes is fine. OK.\n\nWait — but this test string content containing `[\"\\']` might confuse... no, it's a JS string in the test file.\n\nAlso in scanSource test for propertyOnly: `const holder = {}` then `export const value = holder.fs`. `holder` occurrences: definition (var) and `holder.fs`. Not a binding, irrelevant.\n\n`fs` in `{ fs: 1 }`? I removed that. Good — only `holder.fs` → 0 → reported. Good.\n\nSpread test: `export const parts = [...join(\"a\")]` → `join` preceded by '.' but char before is '.' → counts. Good.\n\nOne issue: in the test I assert report.items sorted with the same comparator, which is basically re-implementing; fine.\n\nNow write lib/select-draft.mjs.\n\nKeys exactly. draftHandle returns object literal in the required key order.\n\n```js\nexport const SELECTION_SCHEMA = 'cliworker.selection/v1'\nexport const HANDLE_SCHEMA = 'cliworker.handle/v1'\nexport const HEAVY_REJECT_RISKS = Object.freeze(['exhausted', 'critical', 'low_reserve'])\n```\n\nA-09 checks Object.keys(m).sort() — module exports sorted: HANDLE_SCHEMA, HEAVY_REJECT_RISKS, SELECTION_SCHEMA, draftHandle, draftSelection, heavyRejection. Exactly 6. So I must not export anything else (no default, no helper).\n\nheavyRejection({ key, usage, forecast }) — note destructuring with no default: `heavyRejection({ key, usage, forecast } = {})`.\n\ndraftHandle({ model, call, forecast, quota, adapter }) — model is listModels item with fields key, provider, id, level, identity, identity_group, vendor, readonly, prices.\n\ndraftSelection({ request, level, usage, models, rejected, reason = null, count = 1 }).\n\nLet me write.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8","_messageId":"01a1b80fd3d37dc9be8a3b71d6a64d10","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b80fd3d37dc9be8a3b71d6a64d10","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b80fd3d37dc9be8a3b71d6a64d10","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b80f-d3d3-7dc9-be8a-3b73c3ebbf7a","traceparent":"00-3f40958935830439216b9e572e25ec75-edb47074163b0488-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b80c-10a1-714c-94fe-186218e3e224,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T22:10:14.629Z"}
{"type":"file-history-snapshot","messageId":"01a1b80c-145c-7a18-99a8-89a77117a416","timestamp":1794089414620,"isSnapshotUpdate":true,"snapshot":{"messageId":"01a1b80c-145c-7a18-99a8-89a77117a416","trackedFileBackups":{"scripts\\check-unused.mjs":{"backupFileName":"bd10f18b9226016e@v2","version":2,"backupTime":1794089391388,"existedAtTrack":false},"test\\fixtures\\unused\\clean\\ok.mjs":{"version":1,"backupTime":1794089380542,"existedAtTrack":false},"test\\fixtures\\unused\\dirty\\imports.mjs":{"version":1,"backupTime":1794089380562,"existedAtTrack":false},"test\\fixtures\\unused\\dirty\\functions.mjs":{"version":1,"backupTime":1794089380583,"existedAtTrack":false},"test\\fixtures\\unused\\expected.json":{"version":1,"backupTime":1794089380601,"existedAtTrack":false},"test\\unit\\check-unused.test.mjs":{"version":1,"backupTime":1794089407394,"existedAtTrack":false},"lib\\select-draft.mjs":{"version":1,"backupTime":1794089414620,"existedAtTrack":false}}},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T22:10:14.629Z","_requestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8"}
{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b80f-efe5-73a9-8c5f-5b878f44aad2","session_id":"01a1b80c-10a1-714c-94fe-186218e3e224","message":{"id":"01a1b80fd3d37dc9be8a3b71d6a64d10","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_xFtjzIETE4ShCySGtlj17409","name":"Write","input":{"content":"// Pure draft-view helpers: the selection envelope and the per-model handle for the v1 draft\n// surface. No imports, no clock, no IO — callers hand in every value they already computed.\n\nexport const SELECTION_SCHEMA = 'cliworker.selection/v1'\nexport const HANDLE_SCHEMA = 'cliworker.handle/v1'\nexport const HEAVY_REJECT_RISKS = Object.freeze(['exhausted', 'critical', 'low_reserve'])\n\n/** A Heavy request never selects a model whose forecast is exhausted, critical or low reserve. */\nexport function heavyRejection({ key, usage, forecast } = {}) {\n  if (usage !== 'Heavy') return null\n  if (!HEAVY_REJECT_RISKS.includes(forecast?.risk)) return null\n  return { key, reason: 'E_FORECAST_EXHAUSTION', forecast }\n}\n\n/** The draft handle: one call template, no legacy `cli` alias. */\nexport function draftHandle({ model, call, forecast, quota, adapter } = {}) {\n  return {\n    schema: HANDLE_SCHEMA,\n    key: model.key,\n    provider: model.provider,\n    id: model.id,\n    level: model.level,\n    adapter,\n    identity: model.identity,\n    identity_group: model.identity_group,\n    vendor: model.vendor,\n    readonly: model.readonly,\n    prices: model.prices,\n    quota,\n    forecast,\n    call,\n  }\n}\n\n/** The selection envelope shared by every select call, including the missing-level path. */\nexport function draftSelection({ request, level, usage, models, rejected, reason = null, count = 1 } = {}) {\n  const picked = Array.isArray(models) ? models : []\n  const refused = Array.isArray(rejected) ? rejected : []\n  let resolvedReason = null\n  if (picked.length === 0) resolvedReason = reason === null || reason === undefined ? 'no_eligible_model' : reason\n  return {\n    schema: SELECTION_SCHEMA,\n    ok: picked.length > 0,\n    request,\n    level,\n    usage,\n    models: picked,\n    calls: picked.map((item) => item.call),\n    rejected: refused,\n    reason: resolvedReason,\n    truncated: picked.length < count,\n  }\n}\n","file_path":"C:/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/007/lib/select-draft.mjs"}}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":134586,"output_tokens":1096,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":134400,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8","_messageId":"01a1b80fd3d37dc9be8a3b71d6a64d10","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b80fd3d37dc9be8a3b71d6a64d10","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b80fd3d37dc9be8a3b71d6a64d10","traceparent":"00-3f40958935830439216b9e572e25ec75-edb47074163b0488-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b80c-10a1-714c-94fe-186218e3e224,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T22:10:14.646Z"}
