on cache miss. Good.\n\nDesign §2.3: \"读 config.quotas?.[m.provider] 恰好一次\" — done.\n\nDesign: \"前置过滤、Heavy 拒选、排序比较器、handle 构造都只通过 forecastOf 取 forecast 和 quota\" — done.\n\nNow `usageSamples` exported - yes.\n\nDesign §2.3 default: `buildForecast({ model, quota, samples: usageSamples(records, model), usage, now })` — done.\n\nOne deviation: count cap (documented).\n\nAnother deviation: check-unused output paths relative to scanned path rather than root (documented).\n\nAnother possible deviation: the spread-vs-property refinement (needed for lib/index.js).\n\nLet me also double-check `scanPaths` for a nonexistent path: `fs.statSync` throws → we throw Error with ENOENT. CLI catches → exit 2. Good.\n\nOne risk: `check-unused --root <dir>` with paths relative to root — fine.\n\nNow, `test/unit/check-unused.test.mjs` asserts `report.files === 3` for fixture dir (clean/ok, dirty/imports, dirty/functions) — yes 3.\n\nLet me now look at the final git status to confirm only allowed files changed.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8","_messageId":"01a1b812ca297c97ac2d64e999f8a0e0","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b812ca297c97ac2d64e999f8a0e0","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b812ca297c97ac2d64e999f8a0e0","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b812-ca29-7c97-ac2d-64eb1ca4b1f3","traceparent":"00-3f40958935830439216b9e572e25ec75-edb47074163b0488-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b80c-10a1-714c-94fe-186218e3e224,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b80c14647279947af18522731dd8"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T22:13:27.445Z"}
